convertToDecimals.t.sol
├── when decimals is greater than 95
│  └── it should revert
├── when scaling up overflows UD60x18
│  └── it should revert
├── when decimals is 0
│  └── it should match convert(uint256)
├── when decimals is 18
│  └── it should wrap the integer
├── when decimals is less than 18
│  └── it should scale up to 18 decimals
└── when decimals is greater than 18
   └── it should scale down and round toward zero
